theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 9
text = "You dive into the flooded remains of a civilization swallowed by the sea — broken statues, drowned colonnades, coral-reclaimed stonework. The deeper you go, the older and stranger the ruins become, and the more valuable — and dangerous — the pearls they still guard.

Every choice down there is measured against the one thing no upgrade can buy back: the breath you're already holding."
